 "result": "Flow, all in `src/tessel/sansio/bundles.py` unless noted:\n\n1. **Recording:** `Bundle.attach_route_rule` (L413) (also reached via `@bundle.route`) doesn't touch an app. It calls `Bundle.record` (L230 appends to `deferred_functions`) with a lambda that calls `BundleSetupState.attach_route_rule`.\n2. **Registration:** `Tessel.register_bundle` (`src/tessel/sansio/app.py:571`) calls `Bundle.register(app, options)` (L273).\n3. **Replay:** `Bundle.register` builds a `BundleSetupState` via `make_setup_state` (L246), then loops over `deferred_functions` (L334), calling each with that state.\n4. **Applying to the app:** `BundleSetupState.attach_route_rule` (L87) applies the URL prefix and subdomain, merges URL defaults, and prefixes the endpoint as `<name_prefix>.<bundle name>.<endpoint>`. It then calls `Tessel.attach_route_rule` (`src/tessel/sansio/app.py:606`) on the app, which adds the rule to the app's URL map.",
